The Android map uses MapLibre Native Android SDK 13.0.2 with OpenFreeMap
styles and OpenStreetMap contributor data. The in-product MapLibre attribution
and logo controls remain enabled; OpenFreeMap, MapLibre, and OpenStreetMap
names, data, styles, and notices retain their applicable attribution and
licence terms.

Groups.io names and service interfaces are used only for operator-authorized
interoperability. ShackCQ contains its own native client and local database;
it does not incorporate Groups.io service source, branding assets, or user
content as a bundled dependency.

