Observatory AIA/HMI. Those names, measurements, images, and data remain the
property of their respective agencies and contributors; no endorsement is
implied.

ITU-R-HF v14.3 at commit cd172be56dc04b154e5d2fa91cbaa6ecf5284305
was reviewed for P.533/P.372 interoperability. No ITU source, data, binary, or
